+++ ed318_v030/ed318-canada-lab-v0.3.0/samples/README.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
@@ -1,5 +0,0 @@
-# Samples
-
-`canada-learning-zones.json` is retained as a synthetic historical learning fixture. It is not official Canadian data, not an ED-318 conformance example, and not evidence of Transport Canada or NAV CANADA policy.
